  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed ground floor flat includes a 'study' that is in excess of single-bedroom minimum size standards. The proposed flat would therefore provide two single bedrooms, whereas the Technical Housing Standards - Nationally Described Space Standard (2015) require that any dwelling with two or more bedspaces must include at least one double (or twin) bedroom. Furthermore, the overall gross internal floor area of the unit fails to meet the minimum gross internal floor area for a dwelling of this size and occupancy, as set out in the NDSS (2015). As such, the proposal fails to comply with Paragraphs 9(A) and 9(B) of Article 3 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
  ],
